// A friend spots you and comes over to say hello (design doc: Friendship, deepened - ponies take
// initiative). Speech only: the first line is said in chat, in their voice. Once a day per friend.
//
// PLACEHOLDER LINES - every line here is meant to be rewritten.

=== seek_hello
start: seek
{pony}: Hey, {player}! I was hoping I'd run into you today!
    or: {player}! Fancy seeing you here. Got a minute?
    or: Oh good, it's you! Come say hi!

=== seek_close_friend
start: seek
weight: 3
when: trust >= high
{pony}: There you are! I've been looking all over for you!

// News they couldn't wait to share - real gossip about another pony (see real_gossip in idle_chatter).
=== seek_news
start: seek
weight: 4
weight: +4 if quirk(gossip)
when: gossip
{pony}: {player}! Did you hear about {gossip_subject}? You have to hear this!
~ tell_gossip

=== seek_morning
start: seek
weight: 2
when: time_of_day(morning)
{pony}: Morning, {player}! Sleep well?

=== seek_grieving
start: seek
weight: 6
tone: gentle
when: mood(grief, clear)
{pony}: *quietly* ...Hi. I didn't want to be alone just now.
